description	"Rebel SpecForce Sniper

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (2)
- E-11 Blaster Rifle (3)
- Projectile Rifle
- 1 Frag Grenade

^6Inventory:
- Portable Sentry Gun

A sniper, or sharpshooter, was an individual trained to shoot a high powered rifle from a far distance away from the front lines, often hundreds of meters away, and most of the time from concealed and/or high location. Patience, control, and cunning were some of the attributes that were needed for their profession, but stealth was considered the greatest asset; the ability to dispose of targets without warning and with uncanny accuracy caused the Rebel SpecForce to train more snipers than the Imperials."